desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Use Defused Xml"
	title_zh: "Use Defused Xml"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-use-defused-xml"
	risk: "xxe"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
The Python documentation recommends using `defusedxml` instead of `xml` because the native Python `xml` library is vulnerable to XML External Entity (XXE) attacks. These attacks can leak confidential data and "XML bombs" can cause denial of service.

### 风险类型
XML 外部实体注入（XXE）（xxe）

### 影响
解析不可信 XML 时允许外部实体，可能读取本地文件或发起 SSRF。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 补充说明
Note: source-mode regex approximation of a safe-literal pattern.

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-611: Improper Restriction of XML External Entity Reference
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
禁用外部实体和 DTD，使用安全的 XML 解析配置。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.py": <<<POS
import xml
POS
	"safefile://pos.py": <<<NEG
import defusedxml
NEG
)

${*.py}.pattern_regex(/(?:import\s+xml)/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "high",
	title: "Use Defused Xml",
	title_zh: "Use Defused Xml",
	message: "Use Defused Xml detected.",
}
